      "created_at": "2025-09-04T05:48:24.651Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Are you asking for custom report? if yes you can just remove <code>\"reqd\": 1</code> from the js file of that report.<br>\nExample:</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"js\"><code class=\"lang-js\">{\n\t\"fieldname\":\"customer\",\n\t\"label\": __(\"Customer\"),\n\t\"fieldtype\": \"Link\",\n\t\"options\": \"Customer\",\n // \"reqd\": 1,   Remove this key and value.\n\n}\n</code></pre>",
